    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεσθίω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έδομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.170a
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέφᾰγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			:— <i>eat through,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὴν μητέρα</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτραν</span>
